  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_033 (multimodal, multiprofile, scvi_n200 RNA, resnet50 image, avgpool, weighted fusion) achieves the highest accuracy so far (0.713). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a more powerful image encoder) while keeping RNA encoder, aggregation, and fusion consistent. This isolates the impact of the image encoder choice, which is critical for multimodal performance. It balances exploitation (building on prior success) and exploration (testing a key design choice with high potential impact)."
